# Incremental Implementation

Build one complete slice → test → verify → commit → next slice.

## Rules
- One logical change per commit; keep tests green between slices
- Vertical slices preferred (contract → gateway → core → test)
- Simplest thing that works; no abstractions before third use case
- Touch only files required by the current ticket
- Note out-of-scope improvements; do not fix them in the same commit

## LakanVault verification after each slice
```powershell
python scripts/verify_boundaries.py
python -m pytest tests/ -q
```

## Slice size
Target ~100 lines changed. If larger, split the ticket.
